00:16:25,013 --> 00:16:27,323
(Laughter)

288
00:16:27,323 --> 00:16:30,496
I see you, I feel you,

289
00:16:30,496 --> 00:16:36,253
(Laughter)

290
00:16:36,253 --> 00:16:42,227
It cannot wait, I'm yours.

291
00:16:42,227 --> 00:16:47,600
we did amazing things.

292
00:16:47,600 --> 00:16:52,682
I'd go wherever you will --

293
00:16:52,682 --> 00:16:58,244
(Laughter)

294
00:16:58,244 --> 00:17:03,400
I can't live with or without you.

295
00:17:03,400 --> 00:17:05,190
When I find myself --

296
00:17:05,190 --> 00:17:07,489
mother Mary comes to me,

297
00:17:07,489 --> 00:17:11,865
No woman, no cry.

298
00:17:11,865 --> 00:17:13,504
Yeah mama, this surely is a dream.

299
00:17:13,504 --> 00:17:15,836
(Laughter)

300
00:17:15,836 --> 00:17:18,863
camped by a billabong.

301
00:17:18,863 --> 00:17:22,253
(Laughter)

302
00:17:22,253 --> 00:17:26,413
but here's my number, so call me

303
00:17:26,413 --> 00:17:30,190
oppan gangnam style. (Laughter)

304
00:17:30,190 --> 00:17:35,932
It's time to say goodbye.

305
00:17:35,932 --> 00:17:45,790
comes from some other beginning's end.

306
00:17:45,790 --> 00:17:49,861
(Applause)

307
00:17:56,911 --> 00:18:01,199
Thank you, thank you.

308
00:18:03,013 --> 00:18:06,856
(Laughter)

309
00:18:07,395 --> 00:18:10,499
And I have a secret to share with you.

310
00:18:10,499 --> 00:18:14,471
So, by playing that song for you,

311
00:18:14,471 --> 00:18:19,221
of practicing the ukulele.

312
00:18:19,221 --> 00:18:23,209
Thank you.

313
00:18:24,933 --> 00:18:28,974
anything that you can think of,

314
00:18:28,974 --> 00:18:30,752
what do you want to do.

315
00:18:30,752 --> 00:18:35,317
something new is not intellectual,

316
00:18:35,317 --> 00:18:40,998
a bunch of little tips or tricks or things.

317
00:18:40,998 --> 00:18:44,753
We're scared.

318
00:18:44,753 --> 00:18:47,140
Feeling stupid doesn't feel good,

319
00:18:47,014 --> 00:18:49,275
anything new

320
00:18:49,275 --> 00:18:51,537
you feel really stupid.

321
00:18:51,537 --> 00:18:55,633
it's emotional.

322
00:18:55,633 --> 00:18:58,971
But put 20 hours into anything.

323
00:18:58,971 --> 00:19:01,377
What do you want to learn?

324
00:19:01,377 --> 00:19:04,848
Want to learn how to cook?

325
00:19:04,848 --> 00:19:07,114
Want to learn how to draw?

326
00:19:07,114 --> 00:19:10,860
What lights you up?

327
00:19:10,860 --> 00:19:14,747
It only takes 20 hours.

328
00:19:14,747 --> 00:19:16,093
Have fun.

329
00:19:16,093 --> 00:19:19,060
(Applause)
